<title>USA: Mako to sell Tracker controlling interest.</title>
<headline>Mako to sell Tracker controlling interest.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mako Marine International Inc said on Thursday it signed a contract to sell a controlling interest in the company to Tracker Marine LP, which makes freshwater fishing and pontoon boats.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, Missouri-based Tracker would buy 6.4 million newly-issued shares of common stock from Mako Marine, for $4.14 million in cash and the contribution of certain assets relating to its saltwater boat division, the company said.</p>
</text>
